WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:14.120
Good morning, everyone.

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:19.170
This is Jack Van Horn from the BD2K Training
Coordinating center at the University of Southern

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:23.220
