Today, we have the pleasure of Ali Shojaie
from the University of Washington who's going

00:00:31.669 --> 00:00:35.010
to be talking on unsupervised machine learning.

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:40.820
This follows on the heels from our talk last
week by Daniella Witten on supervised statistical

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:41.820
learning.

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:43.460
This one makes a nice compliment.

